flowchart TD
    subgraph OFF ["Off chain, never leaves your machine"]
        WILL["the will<br/>nominee to share to payout key"]
        SEC["owner secret"]
        DEV["device key<br/>signs the timestamp"]
        NK["nominee envelope<br/>secret, share, path"]
        PS["proof server<br/>self hosted"]
    end

    subgraph ON ["On chain, one shared registry contract"]
        TAG["ownerTag"]
        SEEN["lastSeen"]
        ROOT["vaultRoot"]
        COIN["heldCoin<br/>qualified shielded coin"]
        WIN["challengeUntil<br/>veto window"]
        RES["resolvedVault"]
        NULL["spent nullifiers"]
    end

    PS -.->|builds every proof, sees every witness| ON
    SEC -->|register| TAG
    SEC -->|heartbeat| SEEN
    DEV -->|heartbeat, second factor| SEEN
    WILL -->|Merkle root only| ROOT
    DEP["shielded deposit"] -->|insertCoin| COIN
    SEEN -->|grace elapsed, resolve| WIN
    WIN -->|window passed, finalize| RES
    SEC -->|veto closes| WIN
    GUARD["2 of 3 guardians<br/>signatures bound to the tag"] -->|veto closes| WIN
    GUARD -->|open early| RES
    RES --> CLAIM{{claim}}
    ROOT --> CLAIM
    NK --> CLAIM
    COIN --> CLAIM
    CLAIM --> NULL
    CLAIM -->|share stays inside a Zswap commitment| OUT["the nominee's coin<br/>at the key bound in their leaf"]
